termsrc:  Term 2.2.4 source code
termsrc:  
termsrc:  SOURCE code for the TERM daemon which allows multiple sessions over a
termsrc:  modem line to another Unix machine also running term. This source code
termsrc:  is not needed to run term on your Linux machine, but you may have to
termsrc:  upload this to your intended term host machine to compile. TERM
termsrc:  has support for these operating systems:
termsrc:  
termsrc:  Linux, NetBSD, SunOS, ULTRIX, IRIX, NeXT, CX/UX, AIX, BSD386, sco386,
termsrc:  vistra800, ptx, iris3d, iris4d, OSF1, m68k, ConvexOS, and HP-UX.
